                       to the key shipped in remi-release-10.2-1.el10.remi. Not found on
                       keys.openpgp.org / keyserver.ubuntu.com - confirm out of band.
                       Remi rotates keys (remi2025, ...): when remi-release starts being
                       signed by a new key, `release-install remi` fails loudly - add the
                       new key here (and to pkg-cache-repos.sh).
